    },
    {
      "document_id": "4531",
      "label": "0",
      "explanation": "The senators are announcing the introduction of legislation to extend child care benefits. The negative clarification explicitly states that merely introducing or cosponsoring a bill that has not passed is position-taking rather than credit-claiming."
    },
    {
      "document_id": "3845",
      "label": "0",
      "explanation": "The senator is expressing his views on OPEC oil production cuts and promoting an unpassed bill he sponsored. Because the bill has not passed and he is criticizing a foreign entity, this represents position-taking."
