    {
      "document_id": "1230",
      "label": "1",
      "explanation": "The senators claim credit as the principal authors of the 1994 DSHEA act which authorized the FDA to write GMP regulations, linking their past legislative action and decade-long pressure directly to the FDA's final publication of the regulations."
